<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your healdesk service ended on Friday 6 November, and AYA has stopped answering.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">For 30 days, until Sunday 6 December, calls that still forward to us pass straight through to your direct line. Undo the forwarding before then, so callers keep reaching you directly. From the clinic&#39;s own line, dial this AT&amp;T code:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>Cancel all-call forwarding: *73</li></ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your website chat shows a contact form until you remove the healdesk snippet from your website.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">We&#39;ll email you when your export of conversation records and the booking log is ready. Download it by Sunday 6 December.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">We destroy our copies of your data within 30 days of your export being delivered, and by Thursday 4 February 2027 at the latest. Billing records are kept, as tax law requires.</p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
