<title>Your healdesk account has closed</title>
<style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body, .hd-wrap { background: #0d1117 !important; color: #e6edf3 !important; }
  .hd-muted { color: #9da7b3 !important; }
  a { color: #8cc4ff !important; }
  a.hd-action { background: #e6edf3 !important; color: #0d1117 !important; }
}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">Setup wasn&#39;t finished within 30 days. Nothing more will be charged.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The 30-day setup window for Radiance Med Spa ended on Friday 6 November with nothing answering clients, so the account has closed.</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>Nothing more will be charged. The setup fee is not refunded, as the terms say.</li><li>AYA answers no one for Radiance Med Spa. Calls and messages reach you exactly as they did before.</li><li>We keep the signed agreement and the billing records the law requires us to keep.</li></ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If you&#39;d like to set AYA up after all, reply to this email and we&#39;ll help you start again.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Questions? Reply to this email, or write to hello@healdesk.io. Or leave a message on (888) 555-0100: we reply the next business day. Please don&#39;t include client details.</p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk account.</p>
