<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Radiance Med Spa asked us to send you these steps. They forward the practice&#39;s main line to AYA, its AI assistant from healdesk, so the calls the front desk can&#39;t take are answered. It takes a few minutes, from the practice&#39;s own phone.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Forward calls to:</strong> (512) 555-0142</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The steps for AT&amp;T:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>Forward when the line is busy: *905125550142</li><li>Forward when nobody answers (after 3–4 rings): *925125550142</li></ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">To undo it at any time:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>Cancel busy forwarding: *91</li><li>Cancel no-answer forwarding: *93</li></ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Easier with someone on the line? Book a five-minute call and we&#39;ll do it with you.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/help/call" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Book a five-minute call</a></p>
