exports[`ops alerts beyond the fixture > a leaving practice with no export delivered: the snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<title>healdesk ops: A leaving practice has no export delivered</title>
<style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body, .hd-wrap { background: #0d1117 !important; color: #e6edf3 !important; }
  .hd-muted { color: #9da7b3 !important; }
  a { color: #8cc4ff !important; }
  a.hd-action { background: #e6edf3 !important; color: #0d1117 !important; }
}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">Deliver this practice&#39;s export, and record the handover on its care page, before the time below: Terms §7 promises every leaving practice its export within 30 days of the end, whether or not it asks. Its data is destroyed at that time whether or not the export was delivered, because its agreement gives thirty days, or it has none on file.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Deliver this practice&#39;s export, and record the handover on its care page, before the time below: Terms §7 promises every leaving practice its export within 30 days of the end, whether or not it asks. Its data is destroyed at that time whether or not the export was delivered, because its agreement gives thirty days, or it has none on file.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Event:</strong> export_undelivered_before_destruction</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Clinic id:</strong> 0c1d2e3f-0000-4000-8000-000000000000</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Destruction due (UTC):</strong> 2026-11-30T10:00:00.000Z</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Raised:</strong> 2026-10-06 14:32 UTC</p>
